.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-f7d5011261ee2fac824da41ab08d0aa03a6185f5%252FScreenshot%25202026-05-08%2520at%252017.10.45.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a39b22f728cab45d12fc71032473e2b2&amp;sv=3" srcSet="https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-f7d5011261ee2fac824da41ab08d0aa03a6185f5%252FScreenshot%25202026-05-08%2520at%252017.10.45.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a39b22f728cab45d12fc71032473e2b2&amp;sv=3 400w, https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-f7d5011261ee2fac824da41ab08d0aa03a6185f5%252FScreenshot%25202026-05-08%2520at%252017.10.45.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a39b22f728cab45d12fc71032473e2b2&amp;sv=3 800w, https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-f7d5011261ee2fac824da41ab08d0aa03a6185f5%252FScreenshot%25202026-05-08%2520at%252017.10.45.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a39b22f728cab45d12fc71032473e2b2&amp;sv=3 1200w, https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-f7d5011261ee2fac824da41ab08d0aa03a6185f5%252FScreenshot%25202026-05-08%2520at%252017.10.45.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a39b22f728cab45d12fc71032473e2b2&amp;sv=3 768w, https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-f7d5011261ee2fac824da41ab08d0aa03a6185f5%252FScreenshot%25202026-05-08%2520at%252017.10.45.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a39b22f728cab45d12fc71032473e2b2&amp;sv=3 1536w, https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-f7d5011261ee2fac824da41ab08d0aa03a6185f5%252FScreenshot%25202026-05-08%2520at%252017.10.45.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a39b22f728cab45d12fc71032473e2b2&amp;sv=3 2304w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 400px, 768px" width="1020" height="696"/></div></div></div></div><h4 id="how-path-matching-works" class="text-base @xs:text-lg @lg:text-xl font-semibold heading font-heading pdf-heading block pr-6 pointer-fine:flex pointer-fine:items-baseline pointer-fine:pr-0 scroll-mt-(--content-scroll-margin) text-start self-start justify-start relative group/hash decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid column-first-of-type:pt-0 pt-[0.5em]" data-heading-reveal-wrapper="true"><span data-cover-aware-text="" class="pointer-fine:flex-1 z-1 justify-self-start max-w-full break-words page-cover-background:text-contrast-cover text-start self-start justify-start leading-snug">How path matching works</span><span class="hash inline-grid grid-area-1-1 pointer-fine:h-[1em] border-0 opacity-0 pointer-events-none site-background rounded transition-opacity pointer-fine:pointer-events-auto pointer-fine:group-hover/hash:opacity-100 pointer-fine:group-focus-within/hash:opacity-100 [.hash-revealed_&amp;]:opacity-100 [.hash-revealed_&amp;]:pointer-events-auto absolute [transform:translateY(0.17em)] pointer-fine:-ml-6 pointer-fine:relative pointer-fine:order-first pointer-fine:self-center pointer-fine:pr-2 pointer-fine:[transform:none] pointer-fine:[.flip-heading-hash_&amp;]:order-last pointer-fine:[.flip-heading-hash_&amp;]:ml-1 pointer-fine:[.flip-heading-hash_&amp;]:pl-2"><a class="inline-flex items-center p-1 pointer-fine:h-full pointer-fine:p-0 leading-snug" aria-label="Direct link to heading" href="#how-path-matching-works"><svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon self-center transition-colors text-transparent pointer-fine:group-hover/hash:text-tint-subtle contrast-more:pointer-fine:group-hover/hash:text-tint-strong pointer-fine:group-focus-within/hash:text-tint-subtle contrast-more:pointer-fine:group-focus-within/hash:text-tint-strong [.hash-revealed_&amp;]:text-tint-subtle contrast-more:[.hash-revealed_&amp;]:text-tint-strong size-4"><path fill="currentColor" d="M202.2 .4c8.6 1.9 14.1 10.4 12.3 19L191.2 128 375.8 128 400.5 12.6c1.9-8.6 10.4-14.1 19-12.3s14.1 10.4 12.3 19L408.5 128 496 128c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16s-7.2 16-16 16l-94.4 0-41.1 192 87.5 0c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16s-7.2 16-16 16l-94.4 0-24.7 115.4c-1.8 8.6-10.4 14.1-19 12.3s-14.1-10.4-12.3-19l23.3-108.7-184.6 0-24.7 115.4c-1.9 8.6-10.4 14.1-19 12.3s-14.1-10.4-12.3-19L103.6 384 16 384c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16s7.2-16 16-16l94.5 0 41.1-192-87.6 0c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16s7.2-16 16-16l94.5 0 24.7-115.4c1.9-8.6 10.4-14.1 19-12.3zM184.4 160l-41.1 192 184.6 0 41.1-192-184.6 0z"/></svg></a></span></h4><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-start self-start justify-start">Paths are matched with a <strong class="font-bold">starts with</strong> rule from the repository root. Entering a directory path excludes that directory and everything under it, including all files and folders.</p></div><div class="hint transition-colors rounded-corners:rounded-md circular-corners:rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-warning border-warning text-sm grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid" aria-label="Warning" role="note"><div class="py-4 pl-4 text-warning-subtle contrast-more:text-warning"><svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon size-[1.2em] mt-px leading-normal"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 512a256 256 0 1 1 0-512 256 256 0 1 1 0 512zm0-480a224 224 0 1 0 0 448 224 224 0 1 0 0-448zm0 352a24 24 0 1 1 0-48 24 24 0 1 1 0 48zm0-256c13.5 0 24.3 11.4 23.5 24.9l-7.6 136c-.5 8.5-7.5 15.1-16 15.1s-15.5-6.6-16-15.1l-7.6-136c-.8-13.5 10-24.9 23.5-24.9z"/></svg></div><div class="p-4 pl-3 empty:p-0 -row-end-1 -col-end-1 min-w-0 space-y-3 [&amp;_.hint]:border [&amp;_pre]:border [&amp;_pre]:border-neutral"><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong links-default:[&amp;_a:not(.button)]:text-warning links-default:[&amp;_a:not(.button):hover]:text-warning-strong links-default:[&amp;_a:not(.button)]:decoration-warning/6 links-accent:[&amp;_a:not(.button)]:decoration-warning decoration-warning/6 [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-warning-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-warning-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong links-default:[&amp;_a:not(.button)]:text-warning links-default:[&amp;_a:not(.button):hover]:text-warning-strong links-default:[&amp;_a:not(.button)]:decoration-warning/6 links-accent:[&amp;_a:not(.button)]:decoration-warning decoration-warning/6 [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-warning-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-warning-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start"><strong class="font-bold">Wildcards are not supported.</strong> Characters like <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">*</code> are treated as literal characters in the path, not as a pattern. For example, <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">/path/*</code> excludes a file or folder literally named <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">*</code>, not every file under <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">/path</code>. To exclude an entire directory, enter the directory path itself (e.g. <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">/path</code>).</p></div></div></div><div class="decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl layout-wide:max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full print:break-inside-avoid flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl layout-wide:max-w-6xl print:break-inside-avoid relative mx-auto grid w-full min-w-0"><div class="w-full min-w-0 overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden overscroll-x-none border-tint-subtle"><div class="flex flex-col min-w-full w-fit" role="table"><div role="rowgroup" class="mb-1 flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-tint-subtle bg-tint overflow-hidden min-w-full w-fit"><div role="row" class="flex w-full"><div role="columnheader" class="relative px-3 py-2 font-medium text-sm text-tint-strong text-left" style="width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%);min-width:100px" title="Path you enter">Path you enter</div><div role="columnheader" class="relative px-3 py-2 font-medium text-sm text-tint-strong text-left" style="width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%);min-width:100px" title="What gets excluded">What gets excluded</div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col min-w-full w-fit"><div role="rowgroup" class="flex flex-col min-w-full w-fit [&amp;&gt;*+*]:border-t"><div class="flex group/row border-tint-subtle transition-colors hover:bg-tint-hover" role="row"><div role="cell" class="relative flex flex-1 border-r px-3 py-2 align-middle text-sm last:border-r-0 border-tint-subtle" style="width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%);min-width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%)"><div class="blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start"><code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">/services/legacy</code></p></div></div><div role="cell" class="relative flex flex-1 border-r px-3 py-2 align-middle text-sm last:border-r-0 border-tint-subtle" style="width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%);min-width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%)"><div class="blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start">The <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">services/legacy</code> directory and all files and folders under it</p></div></div></div><div class="flex group/row border-tint-subtle transition-colors hover:bg-tint-hover" role="row"><div role="cell" class="relative flex flex-1 border-r px-3 py-2 align-middle text-sm last:border-r-0 border-tint-subtle" style="width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%);min-width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%)"><div class="blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start"><code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">/apps/admin</code></p></div></div><div role="cell" class="relative flex flex-1 border-r px-3 py-2 align-middle text-sm last:border-r-0 border-tint-subtle" style="width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%);min-width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%)"><div class="blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start">The <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">apps/admin</code> directory and everything nested inside it</p></div></div></div><div class="flex group/row border-tint-subtle transition-colors hover:bg-tint-hover" role="row"><div role="cell" class="relative flex flex-1 border-r px-3 py-2 align-middle text-sm last:border-r-0 border-tint-subtle" style="width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%);min-width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%)"><div class="blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start"><code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">/README.md</code></p></div></div><div role="cell" class="relative flex flex-1 border-r px-3 py-2 align-middle text-sm last:border-r-0 border-tint-subtle" style="width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%);min-width:clamp(100px, calc((100% - 0px) / 2), 100%)"><div class="blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start">Only the file <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">README.md</code> at the repository root</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><h2 id="upload-data" class="text-xl @xs:text-2xl @lg:text-3xl font-semibold heading font-heading pdf-heading block pr-6 pointer-fine:flex pointer-fine:items-baseline pointer-fine:pr-0 scroll-mt-(--content-scroll-margin) text-start self-start justify-start relative group/hash decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid column-first-of-type:pt-0 pt-[1em]" data-heading-reveal-wrapper="true"><span data-cover-aware-text="" class="pointer-fine:flex-1 z-1 justify-self-start max-w-full break-words page-cover-background:text-contrast-cover text-start self-start justify-start leading-tight">Upload Data</span><span class="hash inline-grid grid-area-1-1 pointer-fine:h-[1em] border-0 opacity-0 pointer-events-none site-background rounded transition-opacity pointer-fine:pointer-events-auto pointer-fine:group-hover/hash:opacity-100 pointer-fine:group-focus-within/hash:opacity-100 [.hash-revealed_&amp;]:opacity-100 [.hash-revealed_&amp;]:pointer-events-auto absolute [transform:translateY(0.125em)] pointer-fine:-ml-6 pointer-fine:relative pointer-fine:order-first pointer-fine:self-center pointer-fine:pr-2 pointer-fine:[transform:none] pointer-fine:[.flip-heading-hash_&amp;]:order-last pointer-fine:[.flip-heading-hash_&amp;]:ml-1 pointer-fine:[.flip-heading-hash_&amp;]:pl-2"><a class="inline-flex items-center p-1 pointer-fine:h-full pointer-fine:p-0 leading-tight" aria-label="Direct link to heading" href="#upload-data"><svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon self-center transition-colors text-transparent pointer-fine:group-hover/hash:text-tint-subtle contrast-more:pointer-fine:group-hover/hash:text-tint-strong pointer-fine:group-focus-within/hash:text-tint-subtle contrast-more:pointer-fine:group-focus-within/hash:text-tint-strong [.hash-revealed_&amp;]:text-tint-subtle contrast-more:[.hash-revealed_&amp;]:text-tint-strong size-4"><path fill="currentColor" d="M202.2 .4c8.6 1.9 14.1 10.4 12.3 19L191.2 128 375.8 128 400.5 12.6c1.9-8.6 10.4-14.1 19-12.3s14.1 10.4 12.3 19L408.5 128 496 128c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16s-7.2 16-16 16l-94.4 0-41.1 192 87.5 0c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16s-7.2 16-16 16l-94.4 0-24.7 115.4c-1.8 8.6-10.4 14.1-19 12.3s-14.1-10.4-12.3-19l23.3-108.7-184.6 0-24.7 115.4c-1.9 8.6-10.4 14.1-19 12.3s-14.1-10.4-12.3-19L103.6 384 16 384c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16s7.2-16 16-16l94.5 0 41.1-192-87.6 0c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16s7.2-16 16-16l94.5 0 24.7-115.4c1.9-8.6 10.4-14.1 19-12.3zM184.4 160l-41.1 192 184.6 0 41.1-192-184.6 0z"/></svg></a></span></h2><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-start self-start justify-start">Files cover the structural elements that the code doesn&#x27;t reveal.</p></div><ul class="min-w-0 space-y-2 decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full"><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><strong class="font-bold">OpenAPI Specs (JSON / YAML):</strong> Gives the system a complete map of the API surface. This ensures it interacts with and attacks every endpoint, not just the ones it can crawl.</p></div></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><strong class="font-bold">Offline documentation (README.md / Specs):</strong> Provides the system with deep context on the target and its threat model, helping it distinguish between intended design and actual vulnerabilities.</p></div></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><strong class="font-bold">User Role Definitions:</strong> A list of supported roles (e.g., Admin vs. Viewer) and their specific constraints. The system uses this to strictly test what specific users <i class="font-italic">should not</i> be able to access.<!-- --></p></div></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><strong class="font-bold">Workflows &amp; High-Level Structure:</strong> Descriptions of complex flows (like &quot;Checkout&quot; or &quot;Onboarding&quot;) and the general app structure.</p></div></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><strong class="font-bold">Previous Pentest Reports (PDF):</strong> Feeds the system historical data. It uses this to validate past fixes (regression testing) and hunt for variations of those specific bugs elsewhere in the code.</p></div></div></li></ul><div class="hint transition-colors rounded-corners:rounded-md circular-corners:rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-info border-info theme-muted-tint:bg-info-solid/2 [html.sidebar-filled.theme-bold.tint_&amp;]:bg-info-solid/2 text-sm grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid" aria-label="Information" role="note"><div class="py-4 pl-4 text-info-subtle contrast-more:text-info"><svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon size-[1.2em] mt-px leading-normal"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 32a224 224 0 1 1 0 448 224 224 0 1 1 0-448zm0 480a256 256 0 1 0 0-512 256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM208 352c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16s7.2 16 16 16l96 0c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16s-7.2-16-16-16l-32 0 0-112c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16l-48 0c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16s7.2 16 16 16l32 0 0 96-32 0zm48-168a24 24 0 1 0 0-48 24 24 0 1 0 0 48z"/></svg></div><div class="p-4 pl-3 empty:p-0 -row-end-1 -col-end-1 min-w-0 space-y-3 [&amp;_.hint]:border [&amp;_pre]:border [&amp;_pre]:border-neutral"><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-neutral-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-neutral-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-neutral-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-neutral-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start"><strong class="font-bold">Data persistance</strong></p></div><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-neutral-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-neutral-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-neutral-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-neutral-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start">We persist your data encrypted for two pragmatic reasons:</p></div><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-neutral-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-neutral-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-neutral-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-neutral-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start">1. Continuous Pentesting &amp; Repeatability Security isn&#x27;t a one-off. When you trigger a re-scan or a continuous test, we use these attack resources to ensure the test is consistent. You don&#x27;t want to re-configure the scope every time a scan is triggered.</p></div><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-neutral-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-neutral-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-neutral-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-neutral-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start">2. Audit &amp; Legal Defense For SOC2 or ISO 27001, you need to prove <i class="font-italic">how</i> you tested. We maintain this data to create a defensible audit trail. It allows you to justify exactly what was in scope, and prove that the test was done with full white-box visibility, not just a superficial scan.<!-- --></p></div></div></div><div class="decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl layout-wide:max-w-6xl mx-auto print:break-inside-avoid flex w-full justify-center"><div class="flex flex-row gap-3"><div class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="relative overflow-hidden after:block after:absolute after:-inset-0 after:pointer-events-none w-fit"><img data-testid="zoom-image" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="block rounded-corners:rounded-sm circular-corners:rounded-2xl" src="https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-56f9092e83705384fce4c16bd7d085ef5c5d1a4f%252Fimage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=6d13047ad9e0e4caaa923de9e7e8c6a1&amp;sv=3" srcSet="htt