oration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><strong class="font-bold">Business Logic:</strong> Explain rules that might look like bugs but aren&#x27;t (e.g., &quot;Admins are allowed to see all user data&quot;).</p></div></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><strong class="font-bold">Architecture Quirks:</strong> &quot;We use a custom implementation of OAuth&quot; or &quot;The database is read-only for this service.&quot;</p></div></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><div data-ask-ai-paragraph="" class="group/ask-ai relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="paragraph decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><strong class="font-bold">Known Gaps:</strong> &quot;The API documentation in the repo is slightly outdated for the payment service.&quot;</p></div></div></li></ul><div class="decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl layout-wide:max-w-6xl mx-auto print:break-inside-avoid flex w-full justify-center"><div class="flex flex-row gap-3"><div class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="relative overflow-hidden after:block after:absolute after:-inset-0 after:pointer-events-none w-fit"><img data-testid="zoom-image" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="block rounded-corners:rounded-sm circular-corners:rounded-2xl" src="https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-cff1aebb8e9814e4b7e28aa18a047b3f8768c1fe%252Fimage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=d1bb7feeb595729dba06acebde1fd5d8&amp;sv=3" srcSet="https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-cff1aebb8e9814e4b7e28aa18a047b3f8768c1fe%252Fimage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=d1bb7feeb595729dba06acebde1fd5d8&amp;sv=3 400w, https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%252Fgit-blob-cff1aebb8e9814e4b7e28aa18a047b3f8768c1fe%252Fimage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=d1bb7feeb595729dba06acebde1fd5d8&amp;sv=3 800w, https://help.aikido.dev/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3149773201-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FyKbzcQGrx7UtrG0nPZZ7%252Fuploads%2